Value DEVICE_ID (\S+)
Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+\s+\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value CAPABILITY (.+?)
Value PLATFORM (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+\s+\S+)

Start
  ^Device ID\s+Local Intrfce\s+Holdtme\s+Capability\s+Platform\s+Port ID
  ^${DEVICE_ID}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${CAPABILITY}\s+${PLATFORM}\s+${PORT_ID} -> Record